  "review_notes": [
    "τὸν Ὀνησιφόρου οἶκον is rule 57's construction: the article governs the head noun across the interposed genitive and takes *the*, and the name stands on *of Onesiphorus*. Reading the article as standing before the name is refused by rule 57 in terms."
